  "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
  "$id": "https://chirpneighbors.local/contracts/asset-quality-evaluation-v2.schema.json",
  "description": "Advisory asset evaluation report structure only. Canonical source labels retain their original catalog, version and raw record. Finite UTF-8 byte budget, knowledge/evidence consistency, exact source and requirement identities, actual bird manifest coverage, trusted scoped contact proof, source-record custody, repair ancestry and supersession require source and independently verified consumer semantics. Synthetic fixtures grant no source approval, biological validation, renderer admission, provider execution or public release. This report never grants admission."
}
